{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1767489,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"The Insider","festival_id":null,"organization_id":13218,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-07T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-14T22:49:51+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/the-insider-ram-lal-anand-college-university-of-delhi-1767489","region":"offline","details":"<div id=\"model-response-message-contentr_7d854bb71314a76b\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"polite\"><strong>All that you need to know about The Insider<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"polite\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"polite\"><strong>Event Overview:<\/strong>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2\">\n<li>The Insider is a dynamic, immersive corporate investigation and information trading competition<\/li>\n<li>Blends elements of financial analysis, deduction, and tactical gameplay<\/li>\n<li>Focuses on strategy, negotiation, and smart decision-making<\/li>\n<li>Challenges participants to build cases, form alliances, and adapt to changing scenarios<\/li>\n<li>Emphasizes skill, analysis, and gameplay over luck<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<strong>Round 1: Online Quiz (Date TBA):<\/strong>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"4\">\n<li>Initial elimination round conducted in quiz format<\/li>\n<li>Focuses on corporate fraud, investigation concepts, and strategic thinking<\/li>\n<li>Tests fundamentals, analytical ability, and quick decision-making under pressure<\/li>\n<li>Top teams will qualify for the next round<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<strong>Round 2: On-Campus Simulation (Date TBA):<\/strong>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<li>Shortlisted teams participate in an on-campus simulation<\/li>\n<li>Involves an interactive and fast-paced strategic gameplay environment following a structured timeline:\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1\">\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Case:<\/strong> Teams receive the company background, suspects, and initial evidence over 15 minutes, utilizing case files and suspect profiles<\/li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Follow the Money:<\/strong> Teams spend 20 minutes analyzing financial records and identifying suspicious transactions using financial evidence<\/li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sealed Evidence:<\/strong> Teams have 20 minutes to unlock confidential envelopes containing additional secret clues<\/li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Information Market:<\/strong> Teams spend 20 minutes exchanging or negotiating for missing information using information tokens and clues<\/li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Connect the Dots:<\/strong> Teams spend 20 minutes connecting suspects, transactions, and evidence to build the case using chart papers, thread, and sticky notes<\/li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Boardroom:<\/strong> Teams spend 25 to 30 minutes presenting their conclusion using their final evidence board and answering judges' cross-questions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<strong>Call To Action:<\/strong>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>Participate to experience strategy-driven competitive gameplay<\/li>\n<li>Showcase your ability to think, adapt, and outplay opponents<\/li>\n<li>Take control, make impactful decisions, and compete with top minds<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>","overall_prizes":""